{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55372","headline":"示舍弃慕道颂 · 文益","name":"示舍弃慕道颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东堂不折桂，南华不学僊，却来乾竺寺，披衣效坐禅。\n禅若效坐得，非想亦何偏。\n（经刼守闲，不出生死。\n）爲报参禅者，须悟道中玄。\n如何道中玄，真规自宛然。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}